<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mfrac></m:math></item></list></para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1294403" class="try">
